          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical Spa Technician:",
            "answer": "<p>In high-volume clinical aesthetics, room turnover speed directly dictates clinic profitability. This modular tower layout optimizes workflow integration by providing a dedicated, built-in tissue dispenser, glove box holder, and trash receptacle. Technicians can execute advanced deep-cleansing peeling steps and instantly transition to calming modalities without walking away from the sterile zone, maintaining client connection throughout the service.</p>"
          }
        },
